{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24290","headline":"将归渭村先寄舍弟 · 白居易","name":"将归渭村先寄舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年年觉此身衰，一日日知前事非。\n咏月嘲风先要减，登山临水亦宜稀。\n子平嫁娶贫中毕，元亮田园醉里归。\n爲报阿连寒食下，与吾酿酒扫柴扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}